## Children

Kariba Lake Connect is for adults. You must be 18 or older to create an account or make a booking, and we don't knowingly collect personal information from anyone under 18. The booking form asks only for the size of a group, not details of the children in it. If you think a child has given us their information, contact privacy@[domain] and we will delete it.

## Cookies and local storage

We don't set advertising or analytics cookies.

When you sign in, our sign-in provider stores a sign-in token in your browser's local storage, so you stay signed in between visits. It is removed when you sign out. Without it you can't use the signed-in parts of the website.

The photograph and font providers named in "What we collect" may set or read their own cookies under their own policies when your browser loads their content.

## Marketing

We send marketing messages only if you opted in when you signed up. You can withdraw at any time by emailing privacy@[domain]. Withdrawing doesn't affect your account or bookings.

## Changes to this policy

We may update this policy. Each version has a version number and a date. When we publish a new version that you need to accept, we ask you to read and accept it the next time you sign in.

